  "new_regression_evidence": [
    "A recorded prompt stop creates one immutable checkpoint and automatic job; repeated passes and daemon restart do not dispatch again.",
    "Manual mode freezes a checkpoint without a model call, and automatic mode does not bulk-judge stops from an earlier feedback epoch.",
    "Off, appended work and manual corrections retire obsolete queued automatic jobs before model dispatch or assessment replacement.",
    "Concurrent background workers share one durable lease and commit one canonical assessment revision.",
    "Recovery validates cached judge input/output against the committed canonical revision and repairs only its receipt even after mode off.",
    "Daemon cancellation stops pending background work while preserving the uncertain attempt identity and live lease for recovery.",
    "Local IPC reports the default off mode, rejects automatic mode without a judge, and persists manual/off mode changes.",
    "CLI help exposes the documented status, mode, register, learning and improve commands and off/manual/automatic values."
  ],
  "remaining_acceptance": [
    "Blinded model reference review and comparator calibration on actual historical ACP trajectories; no usable ACP historical dataset has been located.",
