    "End-to-end maintained harness identity propagation and complete session coverage acceptance beyond controller-scoped fixtures.",
    "Judge overhead and net-cost reporting, post-adoption monitoring, reusable experiment revisions and explicit renewal of exhausted judge jobs.",
    "TUI controls and full isolated capture-to-publication integration, including mixed reload states and backend portability."
